# /TopStor/cmyrepopush.sh.toremove
#
# This file is a placeholder marking the previous, broken
# /TopStor/cmyrepopush.sh as superseded. The old version had:
#
#   1. Wrong image: it tried to mount Apache httpd.conf + htdocs into
#      topstor/abdopuppet:latest, which ships lighttpd, not Apache.
#      The mounts were no-ops; nothing served the bare repos.
#
#   2. No `-it` discipline: the script was killed by `git clean -fd`
#      (run by sibling cmyrepopull.sh) because it lived inside the
#      /TopStor/ working tree as an untracked file.
#
#   3. Wrong IP resolution: it relied on
#      `docker exec etcdclient /TopStor/etcdgetlocal.py clusternodeip`
#      which currently returns 10.11.11.14 (wetty) instead of the
#      real software-container IP, so push was attempted to the
#      wrong host and failed with `errno=No route to host`.
#
# The replacement lives at:
#   - /TopStor/cmyrepopush.sh   (this container, copy of /root/cmyrepopush.sh)
#   - /root/cmyrepopush.sh      (host bind-mount, source of truth)
#
# Safe to `git rm` this .toremove file at any time.